{"parse": {"title": "9TH-19", "pageid": 97024, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-18\" title=\"9TH-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-19</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-20\" title=\"9TH-20\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">19</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A7.91.E9.A9.AC.E6.8B.89.E8.AF.B8.E7.9B.B8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"科马拉诸相\">科马拉诸相</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 科马拉诸相</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Aspects of Madness</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>梦<span class=\"color-value\"></span>幻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>疯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>癫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>古<span class=\"color-value\"></span>老<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>舞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10919</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“敬爱的兀尔德女士：”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i> “是什么让你对监狱中的一切起了兴趣？”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“敬爱的阿莱夫阁下：”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>不论是作为医生还是作家，我恐怕都难以漠视身边的种种境况，尤其在科马拉这般充满冲突与不公的场所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-518501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>若您能给予指点，我希望询问一个问题：有什么方法能够让这座监狱中那无休无止的纷争平息下来？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_at_lishi_21\"><img alt=\"2_6_at_lishi_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png/600px-Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"170\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png/900px-Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_at_lishi_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"3804\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>要终止这一切，必须获得一个真正的故事结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>您的到来，使得本轮的模拟可能迎来此等结局，亦可视为一种胜利。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>胜利是指什么呢？希望您给予更加直白的解答。如果这份胜利的代价将会侵害其他囚犯的生命，恐怕我并不能接受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>另外，请您回答我另一个问题：<br />若我离开，这里的故事与纷争会因此终止吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>重塑之手的淑女格蕾丝会为您放行。<br />但这不过是历史的闭环，周而复始的故事只会在这个监狱里一直上演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>就像我们曾经历过无数次时代的恶习那般，一切并不会停止，直至血管变成通讯电线，器官变成几何式零件，所有的一切都化作油彩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>您的话让我感到茫然。您提到的那些事件曾出现在我的梦境中，像一段段破碎的幻想。难道它们都真实存在过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>但如果它们真实地存在，为何我记不清所有的细节，只有支离的片段……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>无论是科马拉监狱，亦或是这些怪异的梦境，我必须让这一切停止下来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>我到底遗忘了什么？我的记忆被某种力量篡改了吗？我感到有某种重要的事物遗失在了时间的河流之中。也许是某个使命，也许是某种责任……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">德洛丝：</div><div>如果要找回我所遗忘的一切，我应该怎么做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>我不会回答一个已有答案的问题。<br />护送您前来的人一早就告诉了您答案，并许下了一个承诺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>您已距离那个存放真相的地点十分接近。请好好回想一下，您为何会身处此地？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这些我们在瞭望塔的等候室中找到的信件，说明了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿莱夫先生，请你告诉我们，重塑之手究竟和德洛丝女士许诺了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>一个时代。一个能让一无所知的她，记忆起自己使命的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>一个时代……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>所以最后，德洛丝女士请求你将她送到哪里去了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从梦中短暂清醒过来的囚徒沉默了片刻，最后，他的视线看向了虚幻而不存在的远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>南方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>在那片无人的大陆上，重塑之手准备实现那个关于过去与未来的寓言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>一个真正属于神秘学家的时代，一段辉煌的过去，也是所有人的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>而德洛丝女士，与这个寓言有着最深层的联系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>重塑之手究竟在南极筹备着什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但德洛丝女士是主动前往南极，而并非受到了重塑之手的胁迫……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>问话中得到的信息，让基金会的来客心中隐隐滋生不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿莱夫先生，请问她是什么时候启程的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>那是一个同时能看到阴云与太阳的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>同时能看到阴云与太阳的日子……？所以，大概是多久之前？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>具体的……时间？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于能记忆世界上所有书本的每一行字的人而言，他早已丧失了对时间的感知，所能依靠的仅有文字的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无问不答的魔法师陷入了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>同时能看到阴云与太阳……？维尔汀，我知道了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>是三天前！我在街上遇到德洛丝女士的那一天，她并不是在那时候进入监狱的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>那是她离开科马拉监狱，前往南极的日子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>同阿莱夫所说的一样，那是一个被阴云遮蔽的下午，但短暂地出了一会儿太阳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>德洛丝女士启程的时间离得并不远……这是一个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>三天的时间……如果我们马上出发，应该仍有机会追上她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但根据我们在乌斯怀亚当地所收集的信息，重塑之手在三日前轰炸了港口的码头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>现在，没有任何一艘完整的船能够起航……也许这正是重塑之手的打算：他们想要阻止基金会的介入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我会将这里的信息回报给基金会布宜诺斯艾利斯分部。司辰，我们需要寻找别的前往方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>我有一艘船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一艘由重塑所赠送的小船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在往常的数次“暴雨”中，这位科马拉的囚徒正是搭乘它，多次应重塑的邀请前往南极大陆，以躲避回溯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>时间紧迫，阿莱夫先生，你愿意把这艘船借给我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_matou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_matou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_matou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>古老高耸的灯塔旁，一艘破旧不堪的小船正在海浪中摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它看起来如此的渺小，如此的脆弱，仿佛下一个瞬间就会被无情的冰流吞没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>这艘船会自动将你们送至麦克默多港口，重塑之手在南极罗斯海建立的登陆点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一助手将信将疑地打量着面前的小船。她对这位重塑之手的“顾问”并无太多的信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这艘小船，是重塑的工艺吗？它的神秘学能源十分不稳定……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，也许我们在乌斯怀亚等待基金会的救援会比较好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>我很少有认同十四行诗的时候，但不得不说，对于这艘小船能否安全跨越南极周围的洋流，我也持怀疑态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿莱夫先生，你知道重塑之手筹备的仪式，现在进行到何种地步了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>仪式随时会开始——我想，这是重塑之手撤离科马拉监狱的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>在重塑之手离去之时，名为淑女格蕾丝的信徒告诉我，他们会封锁这片海面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>怎会如此，已经来不及了吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>如果你们想要找到德洛丝女士，你们就必须踏上这条相同的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默的时刻，只有汹涌的海浪一如既往，如同某种循环往复的预示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我明白了。阿莱夫先生，后续会有基金会分部的成员前来，对你的行为与病情进行评估，希望你也能耐心地回答他们的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，我们出发吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……好的，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同往常一样，第一助手依旧没有提出自己的疑问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>准备启航的女孩们转向一旁的青年作家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也感谢你这段时间的协助，虚构集。也许你对加入基金会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就在此时，身后传来了建筑物轰然崩塌的巨大声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>发生了什么？！这个方向是……科马拉监狱！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-19"}}